{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-017", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "PC yarn prices rise in India; polyester, viscose & cotton fall", "content": "India’s polyester, viscose and cotton markets showed mixed trends as weak demand, liquidity constraints and pre-Diwali buying weighed on trade.\nPC yarn rose ₹2 (~$0.02) per kg in Ludhiana on costlier cotton, while polyester and speciality yarn in Ludhiana and Surat fell ₹2–3 per kg.\nViscose yarn dropped ₹2–3 per kg in Mumbai and Surat; north Indian cotton fell ₹100–120 per maund amid lower ICE futures.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/pc-yarn-prices-rise-in-india-polyester-viscose-cotton-fall-314594-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-018", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India open to Chinese suppliers, to act on unfair pricing: Goyal", "content": "India is open to Chinese suppliers meeting its growing demand for intermediate goods and raw materials, while unfair pricing concerns will be addressed through established legal channels, Commerce Minister Piyush Goyal said. \nIndia-China trade rose nearly 29 per cent to $91.76 billion in April-September 2026-27.\nGoyal hopes to boost exports to China and ASEAN despite trade and export-curb concerns.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-open-to-chinese-suppliers-to-act-on-unfair-pricing-goyal-314589-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-019", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh & Malaysia open post-LDC FTA talks in Dhaka", "content": "Bangladesh and Malaysia are opening FTA negotiations in Dhaka as Bangladesh seeks preferential market access before LDC graduation.\nAdditional Commerce Secretary Khadiza Nazneen leads Bangladesh’s team, while 30 Malaysian delegates attend talks aimed at advancing an agreement by next year.\nBangladesh exported $282 million to Malaysia and imported $2.29 billion in fiscal 2024–25, official data showed.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-malaysia-open-post-ldc-fta-talks-in-dhaka-314585-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-020", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.67, "keywords": ["loss", "weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton futures extend losses as dollar strengthens", "content": "ICE cotton futures fell for a fourth session as a stronger US dollar, weak grain markets and favourable US harvest weather pressured prices.\nThe December 2026 contract lost 100 points, or 1.26 per cent, to 78.06 cents per pound, taking its four-session loss to 377 points.\nUSDA said 52 per cent of the US cotton crop was harvested by October 25, above the five-year average of 45 per cent.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-futures-extend-losses-as-dollar-strengthens-314584-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-021", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Avery Dennison Q3: What’s driving 10% apparel & retail RFID growth?", "content": "Avery Dennison’s Q3 2026 results, due October 29, 2026, should clarify inventory normalisation, earnings impact, RFID demand and any FY2026 guidance changes.\nManagement estimated Q2 customer inventory stocking added about $0.25 per share to adjusted EPS, with a similar Q3 headwind expected.\nApparel and general-retail RFID trends will indicate the platform’s growth trajectory.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/avery-dennison-q3-what-s-driving-10-apparel-retail-rfid-growth--314583-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-28-022", "date": "2026-10-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.25, "keywords": ["expand", "decline"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "US' Rocky Brands' Q3 sales rise 13.3% as profit climbs", "content": "Rocky Brands reported Q3 2026 net sales of $138.8 million, up 13.3 per cent year on year, as wholesale and retail sales advanced. \nNet income rose to $12.8 million from $7.2 million and gross margin expanded 480 basis points to 45.0 per cent. \nStrong full-price selling and tariff-related benefits lifted profitability, while debt declined 16.6 per cent from a year earlier. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/us-rocky-brands-q3-sales-rise-13-3-as-profit-climbs-314591-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
